   "data": {
    "text": "SET DESIGN\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Era and style of the place\n   2 Main material\n   3 Soft curves to sharp clean lines\n   4 Art on the walls\n   5 How the art is arranged\n   6 Clutter\n   7 Cramped to open\n   8 Run down to spotless\n   9 Layers behind the people\n  10 Dark to bright colors\n  11 How the room is laid out\n  12 Props\n  13 suite: Set design lens\n  14 suite: Dive bar\n  15 suite: Upscale lounge\n  16 suite: Period piece\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 5, CC 17 to 26\n   1 suite: Cold minimalism\n   2 suite: Warm maximalism\n   3 suite: Lived-in home\n   4 pair: When the clutter rises, the room feels more cramped\n   5 pair: When the place runs down, the clothes wear out too\n   6 pair: In a cluttered room, the shots get closer\n   7 pair: In a huge space, the frame goes wide\n   8 pair: A key prop gets its close-up\n   9 pair: A run-down room darkens the mood\n  10 pairs: The set steers the camera"
   },
